WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.650
Reshaping should be driven by the downstream
consumer Long form is

00:00:05.677 --> 00:00:11.562
often more robust for charts modeling and changing
categories Wide

00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:17.423
form is useful for fixed business reports and
interfaces A good pipeline

00:00:17.436 --> 00:00:22.805
can keep a reusable long analytical table and create
wide presentation outputs only where needed
